              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Era abamu ku bazzukulu bo, ab'omubiri gwo n'omusaayi gwo, abaliba bakuzaaliddwa balitwalibwa mu busibe, era baliba balaawe mu lubiri lwa kabaka w'e Babulooni.\"",
